Package: qt6-wayland
Version: @DEB_QTWAYLAND_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://www.qt.io/
Depends: qt6-base, libwayland0
Description: Qt 6 Wayland client platform plugin for the Xios desktop
 The wayland QPA platform plugin plus shell integrations. Qt applications
 started with -platform wayland connect to the iosc compositor and render
 through shared memory buffers in this build; GPU buffer sharing over ANGLE
 arrives with a later qtbase round.
 .
 This is the windowing path for the KDE Plasma Mobile flavor of the Xios
 desktop.
